{"duration_api_ms":218092,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c875c22d-d4d1-4b0b-bc99-2b3968133115","total_cost_usd":0.269398,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15271,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":20831,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":15170},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15271,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":20831,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15271,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15271},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":20831,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15271,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.269398,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":15170,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"All 12 feasible front points lie on one line: d=3.36, b=1.2, cone 69.5, with only flight_path_angle varying. Along it, peak heat flux rises from 244.5k to 295.7k W/m2 and bondline temperature falls from 421.6 K to 393.7 K as the entry steepens. The front ends at max_g=12, which is reached near gamma=-3.6. Cone angle does not change q, T or g: C-f579cc1dc4f8 (cone 70) and C-3eaa6889bf91 (cone 69.5) return identical values. It only affects geometry validity and, slightly, mass fraction. Heatshield mass-fraction margin follows mf proportional to d^2 (fits C-1d0dba942e24, C-8809880a095e and C-bd7e4639d608 to an exponent of about 2.0), which puts the diameter cap near 3.385 m. Larger d and larger b both lower q and T slightly. Geometry becomes invalid for b>=1.3 at cone 70. The next gain is to move the whole front to d~3.38, b=1.25, cone 70, and to densify it in gamma.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-8809880a095e (d 3.38, -3.5) vs C-3eaa6889bf91 (d 3.36, -3.5): q 290670 vs 293170 (-0.85%), T 394.35 vs 394.7, mass margin 0.0029 vs 0.0147.\",\"C-32261086f9cf (d 3.3, b 1.25, cone 70, -3.6): q 301210, T 394.49, mass margin 0.051. Against C-3c561540315e, after correcting for the smaller d, this implies about -0.7% q and -0.3 K T for b +0.05.\",\"C-f579cc1dc4f8 vs C-3eaa6889bf91: identical q, T and g at cone 70 vs 69.5, so cone is neutral for both objectives.\",\"C-bd7e4639d608 (d 3.4) has mass margin -0.0089, so the d cap is about 3.385 at b 1.2.\",\"C-2317645f3652, C-833d4a353d37 and C-de343cfbbecf (b 1.3, cone 70): geometry invalid by -12.7 mm. C-eb482c547f73 (b 1.35): -33.7 mm. Linear extrapolation puts the b limit near 1.27 at cone 70, so b=1.25 is inside the buildable region.\",\"g rises about 1.65 per deg of gamma. Adding d slightly raises g (11.837 at d 3.38 vs 11.829 at 3.36), so gamma steeper than about -3.59 at d 3.38 breaks max_g (C-3c561540315e has margin 0.0005 at d 3.36).\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak g is set mainly by entry angle. That fixes the steepest usable gamma near -3.59 and makes q and T trade off along gamma. For fixed gamma, a larger diameter lowers ballistic coefficient and heat load, and a larger nose radius (b*d) lowers stagnation heating. So the best designs sit at the mass-fraction diameter cap (d~3.38) and the largest buildable bluntness (b~1.25 at cone 70). Cone angle only matters through geometry validity and mass, so it stays at 70. Shifting every gamma point to d 3.38 / b 1.25 should cut q by about 1.5% and T by about 0.6 K. Those are scalings I fitted from the data, extrapolated a small step, not first-principles predictions.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The b effect comes from one comparison (C-32261086f9cf) and is about 0.5-0.7% in q, so the sensitivity is poorly known. The scale-invariance of the geometry limit is assumed, and b=1.26 sits close to the estimated boundary of about 1.27. Mass margin at d 3.385 is predicted to be only about +0.0017, so it could flip infeasible. The d and b corrections are taken as gamma-independent, which is unverified. Hypervolume gains here are small (well under 0.01) because this refines a known front rather than finding a new regime.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow end of the front at d 3.38, b 1.25, cone 70. This should dominate C-1d0dba942e24.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240730,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":421.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Anchors the low-q end of the shifted front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Fills a gap between -1.6 and -1.8 with the improved geometry.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":244930,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front and checks the gamma-independent d/b correction.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -1.9 with improved d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249335,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves coverage of the shallow-mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.1 with improved d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":253945,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.3 with improved d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":258690,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":408.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.45, between the -2.25 and -2.5 rows.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262330,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.6 with improved d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266030,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.9 with improved d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273440,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -3.15 with improved d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -3.4, g about 11.7, so the g margin is comfortable.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":286130,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Direct improvement over C-8809880a095e (d 3.38, b 1.2) at the same gamma, via the larger b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288650,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Cleanest test of the b effect, since it compares directly against C-8809880a095e.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Steep-end point at gamma -3.55 (g about 11.92).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":289915,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Pushes the low-T end while staying inside the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Steepest allowed gamma at d 3.38 (g about 11.986). This is the lowest-T corner of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.59},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":290660,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Defines the extreme low-T end of the front. It is close to the g limit, so it is worth a high-fidelity check.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Tests the diameter cap at 3.385. Predicted mass margin is about +0.0017, from mf proportional to d^2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":275440,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the mass-fraction boundary at b 1.25 and cone 70. The result decides whether later rounds can push d further.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Same d 3.385 test at gamma -3.5, near the g limit, where diameter also raises g slightly.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288040,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the combined gain from d and b near the steep end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Probes b=1.26 near the geometry boundary, which I estimate at about 1.27 for cone 70.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.26,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":283190,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests how close to the geometry boundary b can go and confirms the b sensitivity. A geometry failure would still be informative.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.0 with improved d and b. It dominates C-ffa325abbdc9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251590,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Direct comparison with C-ffa325abbdc9 to quantify the total d and b gain.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -2.75 with improved d and b. It dominates C-920e1e810994.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.75},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269750,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Direct comparison with C-920e1e810994.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Front point at gamma -3.3 with improved d and b. It dominates C-2a316afbf018.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":283590,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Direct comparison with C-2a316afbf018. It also gives a b=1.25 vs b=1.26 comparison against the -3.3 probe above.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f579cc1dc4f8\",\"rationale\":\"Intermediate bluntness b=1.22 at gamma -3.0. With the b=1.25 points, this gives a second b sensitivity point at lower geometry risk.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.22,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":277180,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Separates the b effect from the d effect. Comparing against the d 3.385, b 1.25 point at gamma -3.0 gives the b slope.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":174804,"type":"result","duration_ms":218121,"uuid":"31a433d2-a888-4d55-a542-6206d12c5d94","ttft_stream_ms":1360,"time_to_request_ms":28,"first_content_frame_ms":1360,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
